<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13240" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομόργ-νῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μόρξω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wipe off</i> or <i>away from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ᾽ ἰχῶ χειρὸς ὀμόργνυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.416
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμ᾽ ἀπομόργνυ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				798
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεύκης ἀπὸ δάκρυ᾽ ὀμ.</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				547
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, <i>wipe off from oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομορξαμένω κονίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.739
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομόρξατο δάκρυ</span>
			<i>wiped away his</i> tears, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.304
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρὸν ἀπὸ στομάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.96
				</span></i>
			; abs. in same sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομόρξασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					706
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἱδρῶτα</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				696
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὀργὴν ἀπομορχθείς</span>
			<i>having</i> my anger <i>wiped off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>V.</u>
				560
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπωμοργμένος</span>”
				<i>rubbed bare,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					810b3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wipe clean,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόγγῳ δ᾽ ἀμφὶ πρόσωπα . . ἀπομόργνυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.414
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομόρξατο χερσὶ παρειάς</span>
			<i>wiped her</i> cheeks, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.200
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
